      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2520,
      "text": "Man is created of haste. I will show you My signs, so do not ask Me to hasten them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 325,
      "ruku": 280,
      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2521,
      "text": "They say, “When will this promise come to pass, if you are truthful?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 325,
      "ruku": 280,
      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2522,
      "text": "If only the disbelievers knew the moment when they would be unable to ward the Fire off their faces or their backs, nor would they be helped[16].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 325,
      "ruku": 280,
      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2523,
      "text": "Rather, it will come upon them suddenly and stun them; they will not be able to avert it, nor will they be given respite.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 325,
      "ruku": 280,
      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2524,
      "text": "Indeed, there were messengers before you who were ridiculed, but those who mocked them were encompassed by what they used to ridicule.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 325,
      "ruku": 280,
      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2525,
      "text": "Say, “Who can protect you by night and by day against the Most Compassionate?” Yet they turn away from the admonition of their Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 325,
      "ruku": 281,
      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2526,
      "text": "Do they have gods who can defend them against Us? They cannot even help themselves, nor will they be protected from Us.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 325,
      "ruku": 281,
      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2527,
      "text": "Nevertheless, We have provided for them and their forefathers luxuries which they enjoyed for a long time. Do they not see that We gradually reduce the land from its outlying sides?[17] Is it they who will then prevail?",
      "surah": {
